G1074.def:
**γενεά**, -ᾶς, ἡ
(γίγνομαι), [in LXX chiefly for דּוֹר, דֹּר (Cremer, 148) ;]
1. **race, stock, family** (in NT, γέννημα, which see).
2. **generation**;
(a) **of the contemporary members of a family**: pl., [[Mat.1.17|Mat.1:17]] (cf. [[Gen.31.3|Gen.31:3]], מוֹלֶדֶת); metaphorically, of those alike in character, in bad sense, [[Mat.17.17|Mat.17:17]], [[Mrk.9.19|Mrk.9:19]], [[Luk.9.41; 16.8|Luk.9:41 16:8]], [[Act.2.40|Act.2:40]];
(b) **of all the people of a given period**: [[Mat.24.34|Mat.24:34]], [[Mrk.13.30|Mrk.13:30]], [[Luk.21.32|Luk.21:32]], [[Php.2.15|Php.2:15]]; pl., [[Luk.1.48|Luk.1:48]] esp. of the Jewish people, [[Mat.11.16; 12.39, 41, 42, 45, 16:4 23:36|Mat.11:16 12:39, 41 42, 45 16:4 23:36]], [[Mrk.8.12, 38|Mrk.8:12, 38]] [[Luk.7.31; 11.29, 30-32, 50, 51; 17.25|Luk.7:31 11:29, 30-32, 50, 51 17:25]], [[Act.13.36|Act.13:36]], [[Heb.3.10|Heb.3:10]]" (LXX) ; τὴν γ. αὐτοῦ τίς διηγήσεται, [[Act.8.33|Act.8:33]] (LXX);
(with) the period covered by the life-time of a generation, used loosely in pl. of successive ages: [[Act.14.16; 15.21|Act.14:16 15:21]], [[Eph.3.5|Eph.3:5]], [[Col.1.26|Col.1:26]]; εἰς γενεὰς καὶ γ. (= לִדוֹר וָדוֹר, al.), [[Luk.34.17|Luk.34:17]], al), [[Luk.1.50|Luk.1:50]] εἰς πάσας τὰς γ. τοῦ αἰῶνος τῶν αἰώνων, [[Eph.3.21|Eph.3:21]] (Ellic, in l.; _DCG_, i, 639f.).
† (AS)

G1093.def:
**γῆ**, γῆς, ἡ,
[in LXX for אֲדָמָה ,אֶרֶץ, etc. ;]
1. **the earth, world**: [[Luk.21.35|Luk.21:35]], [[Act.1.8|Act.1:8]], [[Heb.11.13|Heb.11:13]], [[Rev.3.10|Rev.3:10]], al.; opposite to οὐρανός, [[Mat.5.18; 11.25|Mat.5:18 11:25]], [[Mrk.13.27|Mrk.13:27]], al.
2. **land**;
(a) opposite to sea or water: [[Mrk.4.1|Mrk.4:1]], [[Luk.5.3|Luk.5:3]], [[Jhn.6.21|Jhn.6:21]], al.;
(b) **as subject to cultivation**: [[Mat.13.5|Mat.13:5]], [[Mrk.4.8|Mrk.4:8]], [[Luk.13.7|Luk.13:7]], [[Heb.6.7|Heb.6:7]], al.;
(with) **the ground**: [[Mat.10.29|Mat.10:29]], [[Mrk.8.6|Mrk.8:6]], [[Luk.24.5|Luk.24:5]], [[Jhn.8.6|Jhn.8:6]], al.;
(d) **a region, country**: [[Luk.4.25|Luk.4:25]], [[Rom.9.28|Rom.9:28]], [[Jas.5.17|Jas.5:17]]; γῆ Ἰσραήλ, [[Mat.2.20, 21|Mat.2:20, 21]]; Χαλδαίων, [[Act.7.4|Act.7:4]] ἡ Ἰουδαία γῆ, [[Jhn.3.22|Jhn.3:22]] with genitive of person(s), [[Act.7.3|Act.7:3]]
(AS)
